{"verse":20,"translation":"And ⟨את⟩ the northerner I will remove far from upon you, and drive him into a land parched and desolate — ⟨את⟩ his face toward the eastern sea and his rear toward the western sea; and his stench will come up and his reek will go up, for he has magnified ⟨himself⟩ to do.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"and ⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"הצפוני","gloss":"the northerner","readings":["the northerner","the northern army"],"held_by":{"the northerner":["v2","v3","en4"],"the northern army":["v1"]}},{"surface":"ארחיק","gloss":"I will remove far"},{"surface":"מעליכם","gloss":"from upon you"},{"surface":"והדחתיו","gloss":"and I will drive him"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"into"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"a land"},{"surface":"ציה","gloss":"parched"},{"surface":"ושממה","gloss":"and desolate"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩"},{"surface":"פניו","gloss":"his face"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"toward"},{"surface":"הים","gloss":"the sea"},{"surface":"הקדמני","gloss":"the eastern"},{"surface":"וספו","gloss":"and his rear","readings":["and his rear","and his end"],"held_by":{"and his rear":["v1","en4"],"and his end":["v2","v3"]}},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"toward"},{"surface":"הים","gloss":"the sea"},{"surface":"האחרון","gloss":"the western"},{"surface":"ועלה","gloss":"and it will come up"},{"surface":"באשו","gloss":"his stench"},{"surface":"ותעל","gloss":"and it will go up"},{"surface":"צחנתו","gloss":"his reek"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"הגדיל","gloss":"he has magnified"},{"surface":"לעשות","gloss":"to do"}],"pass":"en5","judge":"glm-5.3"}